<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal current account deficit rises Jan-Sept.</title>
<headline>Portugal current account deficit rises Jan-Sept.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's current account deficit rose to 595.2 billion escudos between January and September, compared with a deficit of 436.0 billion in the same year-ago period, the Bank of Portugal said in its latest monthly report.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
